From bcbcb0f59f678918ff9f1b78e77d41822582d8e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Magnus Damm <damm@opensource.se>
Date: Sun, 6 Jul 2025 13:29:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 07/13] ARM: renesas: Add RZ/A2 RZA2MBTC board support

Add initial RZ/A2 RZA2MBTC  board support. Serial console, SPI Flash and
Ethernet are known to work however on-board SDRAM is not yet enabled.

Signed-off-by: Magnus Damm <damm@opensource.se>
Signed-off-by: Pabitra Adhikari <pabitraadhikari@gmail.com>
---
